      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T14:26:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Andy: part of my reservation is customization of the deployment for \"CiaB\". I continue to be concerned that by customizing deployment for a specific development use case may mean that we essentially have an internal fork and may cause issues. I would rather see the deployment be identical regardless of the environment (CiaB, cloud, physical).\n\nAdditionally, I think the plan is to eventually separate the physical deployment from the software components. So if we customize the physical deployment for MAAS it means that we also have to make the same changes for any other physical deployment model. I think this gets expensive and error prone to maintain.\n\nWhat is being accomplished by this skip tag?",
